he board, best day thirty-nine"},{"t":20.44,"end":24.24,"section":"Verse 1","text":"October ran hot with one hundred seventy-five on the sheet"},{"t":24.46,"end":26.94,"section":"Verse 1","text":"ten days straight, no breaks along the way"},{"t":26.94,"end":30.06,"section":"Chorus","text":"Light up the grid, let the green glow"},{"t":30.06,"end":33.78,"section":"Chorus","text":"Every week is a bar, every day is a note"},{"t":33.78,"end":37.26,"section":"Chorus","text":"Turn it up loud, let the bass line roll"},{"t":37.88,"end":41.38,"section":"Chorus","text":"Run it back tomorrow, here we go"},{"t":41.38,"end":45.42,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Right now I'm deep in firstpr and Neko"},{"t":46.32,"end":49.6,"section":"Verse 2","text":"sixty-five repos, JavaScript most of all"},{"t":49.6,"end":52.66,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Cut it like an A M V, every frame in place"},{"t":53.12,"end":56.14,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Mix it like a mashup, every verse in rhyme"},{"t":56.94,"end":60.4,"section":"Breakdown","text":"Light weeks play low, heavy weeks play loud"},{"t":60.4,"end":64.3,"section":"Chorus","text":"Light up the grid, let the green glow"},{"t":64.3,"end":68.06,"section":"Chorus","text":"Every week is a bar, every day is a note"},{"t":68.06,"end":72.44,"section":"Chorus","text":"Turn it up loud, let the bass line roll"},{"t":72.48,"end":75.88,"section":"Chorus","text":"Run it back tomorrow, here we go"},{"t":81.24,"end":86.06,"section":"Outro","text":"That was nine hundred sixteen contributions from Nishal."},{"t":86.236,"end":88.98,"section":"Outro","text":"Tomorrow the numbers change, and the song does too"}],"peaks":[0.817,0.575,0.385,0.281,0.264,0.211,0.173,0.158,0.152,0.483,1.0,0.74,0.482,0.211,0.046,0.479,0.359,0.709,0.508,0.708,0.155,0.124,0.088,0.058,0.618,0.609,0.848,0.383,0.8,0.715,0.626,0.553,0.459,0.362,0.231,0.557,0.615,0.558,0.547,0.689,0.667,0.597,0.643,0.704,0.604,0.599,0.539,0.481,0.366,0.283,0.605,0.117,0.088,0.472,0.571,0.758,0.657,0.879,0.54